 Brand action briefs distinguish recorded requirements and dated source evidence from suggested next steps. Static headcount/store totals do not establish expansion, consolidation, profitability or covenant strength. When current demand evidence is unavailable, the brief says the strategy is unconfirmed. Brand-specific news requires identity evidence; the wider industry feed is still available separately.
